<p>1. Jab chala mashko alam lekar wo saqqa e haram<br />
tha ali jaisa hi alamdaar ka jaaho hasham<br />
keh utha darya..YaAbbas..(4)<br />
keh utha darya iske paas haider ka alam..(2)<br />
chhod de sahil ko pehre daar</p>

<p>2. Al amaa&#39;n ka shor uttha yak ba yak maidan mein<br />
yun laga ke gir hi jayega falak maidan mein<br />
maut ka naara..YaAbbas..(4)<br />
maut ka naara ye gunja door tak maidan mein..(2)<br />
aagaye kya haider e qarraar</p>

<p>3. Tegh se likhega ye jarraar qissa maut ka<br />
ek pal tootega na aada se rishta maut ka<br />
hai faras tera..YaAbbas..(4)<br />
hai faras tera sare maidaa&#39;n farishta maut ka..(2)<br />
