hai teri nazro mein...YaAbbas..(4)<br />
hai teri nazro mein tezi haideri shamsheer si..(2)<br />
aa teri aamad ki aye jarraar</p>

<p>6. Shimr ke jab saamne aaya ali ka laadla<br />
ghayz aaya aasteeno ko ulat kar ye kaha<br />
kya kya lade hai khaibar o badr o tabook mein<br />
ye haath pyaas mein na ruke hai na bhook mein<br />
shohrat hai apni jood o sakha ki mulook mein<br />
hatim se bhi sakhi hai sewa hum sulook mein<br />
bigde hai jab to khoon ke darya bahaye hai<br />
sar dediya hai baat pe jis waqt aaye hai<br />
jung aazma hai saff shikan o qal ageer hai<br />
haibat mein, dabdabe mein, adeemun nazeer hai<br />
duniya ke baadshah hai garde sareer hai<br />
is auj par husain ke darr ke faqeer hai<br />
rutbe pe faqr hai, na shaja&#39;at pe naaz hai<br />
gar hai to bus ghulami e hazrat pe naaz hai<br />
&nbsp;<br />
tab shimr ne kaha, ke fasahat se kya husool<br />
bay&#39;at unhe, to sulho hame bhi nahi qubool<br />
ghaazi pukara,<br />
O najis o murtad o jahool<br />
